ISSUE:
#316 allow for blank ip addresses

I found that in some CI systems they'll often do things like `--ip=$SOME_IP` in the case that `$SOME_IP` is blank or a blank string it would be helpful if we didn't fail out right away and allow for defaulting, this is somewhat similar to https://github.com/spf13/pflag/pull/84 and related to https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/issues/58686

A fix for this issue edited: ipValue.Set. Callers in the same package: FlagSet.Parse, FlagSet.Set, Set, flagValueWrapper.Set. The code below is the version BEFORE the fix.

